{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2022-04-04 16:15:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN APPOINTS FLOYD HUDSON VICE PRESIDENT TRANSPORTATION', 'text': "ATLANTA , APRIL 4, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE: NSC) ANNOUNCED TODAY IT HAS APPOINTED FLOYD HUDSON AS VICE PRESIDENT TRANSPORTATION. HUDSON WAS PREVIOUSLY GENERAL MANAGER OF THE COMPANY'S SOUTHERN REGION."}